Third-party components
================================================================================

Fountain depends on Hex, npm and Go packages that carry their own licenses.
The dependency set is MIT, Apache 2.0, BSD and ISC, with two exceptions worth
naming.

  open_api_spex   Mozilla Public License 2.0. File-level copyleft, compatible
                  with the AGPL. Fountain does not modify its files.

  muzak           CC-BY-NC-ND-4.0. A mutation-testing tool declared
                  `only: :test`. It is not linked into the product and is not
                  present in the release image.

The Sprites Elixir client is pinned to a superfly/sprites-ex tag and carries
that project's license.
